eviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiori is Nozomu's childhood friend and has been living alone in an apartment for a few years because her parents are too busy with their work. A model student with excellent grades, an independent girl, kind and cute, Shiori has all the assets that will make any boy melt with love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she learns that her best friend will start living alone as soon as he enters university, she offers to teach him how to cook and take care of a place to live, in addition to helping him study for his exams by inviting him to come and live with her for a while..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In Aikagi ~After Days~"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bust-Waist-Hips: 85-57-86cm"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57060"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"望（主人公）の幼馴染の女の子。一見地味で物静かだが、明るい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望に対しては淡い好意を抱いており、卒業を間近にして友人に背中を押され、望と期間限定の同棲を始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初めは一緒にいられるだけで……と思っているが、同棲生活をする中で望に対する気持ちが大きくなっていくのを自覚していく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13084","sourceWorkId":"24434","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・望の幼なじみの女の子。 一見地味で物静かだが、明るい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望に対しては淡い好意を抱いており、卒業を間近にして友人に背中を押され、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望と期間限定の同棲を始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初めは一緒に居られるだけで…… と思っているが、同棲生活をする中で"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望に対する気持ちが大きくなっていくのを自覚していく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「そのっ……！　わ、私の……私の家で一緒に暮らしてみない!?」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50632"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb8c8a41596ae6652c34f2ce344b2c9d2327161074b210590366178d6007119b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a23924b23c2cdced3e416d96182e927e5d6f998c502f10e544f0f1ef489369c4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:222032:50632:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69021","characterName":"春原 望","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69021"},"originalCharacterName":"春原 望","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nozomu is the childhood friend of Shiori. As soon as he graduates, Nozomu will start living alone to go to university but having never lived alone until now, he doesn't know how to take care of himself completely, like doing the laundry, hanging out the laundry, making good meals..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It is when he returns from school one day that he confides his problems to Shiori who, having a few years more experience on the subject than he does, then offers to teach him to live alone by inviting him to live some time at home."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69021"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/452a90b6c222dfde40b0f6b7dad61fc61147841dc9f8e73bed4d47cc9cb457c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87c38dc6e4668a81de43c4291224005b1f5018782cf3e4f5e51feaa018760713.webp","width":200,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p4542","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:4340","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4542","name":"あざらしそふと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"au